flowchart TD
    PR[Pull Request Created / Synchronized] --> Pipeline[PR Orchestrator Pipeline\n.github/workflows/pr-pipeline.yml]

    subgraph Stage1 [Stage 1: Pre-Flight & Syntax Gate ~30s]
        Pipeline --> Gate[1. PR Gatekeeper\nMetadata & branch convention]
        Gate -->|Pass| Lint[2. Linters & Formatters\nSuper-Linter / ESLint / Prettier]
        Gate -->|Fail: needs-metadata| FixMeta[🤖 PR Validation Agent\nDirect API Update]
        Lint -->|Fail: lint-failed| FixLint[🤖 PR Lint Fixer\nDirect Commit Push]
    end

    subgraph Stage2 [Stage 2: Build Verification ~30s]
        Lint -->|Pass| Build[3. Build & Compilation Gate\nNode/TS, Go, Rust, Java, .NET]
        Build -->|Fail: build-failed| BlockBuild[❌ Pipeline Halted]
    end

    subgraph Stage3 [Stage 3: Deep Verification in Parallel ~1-2m]
        Build -->|Pass| Tests[4. Tests & Coverage Gate\nDiff-scoped >= 80%]
        Build -->|Pass| Security[5. Code Quality & Security\nCodeQL SAST, Dep Review, Secrets]
        Build -->|Pass| DocEval[6. Documentation Drift Gate\npr-docs.yml + gh-aw semantic evaluator]
    end

    subgraph Auto_Consolidation [Autonomous Remediation & Auto-Merge]
        Tests -->|test-required| AgentTest[🤖 PR Test Generator]
        Security -->|alerts| AgentSec[🤖 PR Security Fixers]
        DocEval -->|docs-required| AgentDoc[🤖 PR Doc Updater]
        AgentTest & AgentSec & AgentDoc --> StackedPRs[Stacked PRs targeting feature branch]
        StackedPRs --> AutoConsolidate[7. Auto-Merge Stacked PRs\n.github/workflows/pr-stacked-merge.yml\nSquash into feature branch, clear labels & post audit links]
    end

    AutoConsolidate --> Pipeline
    FixMeta & FixLint --> Pipeline

    subgraph Code_Review [Stage 4: Review & Final Sign-Off]
        Tests & Security & DocEval -->|All Gates Pass & Labels Cleared| Dispatcher[8. PR Review Dispatcher\nPost consolidated summary]
        Dispatcher --> CopilotReview[GitHub Copilot Code Review\nAI semantic & architecture review\n1-click commit suggestions]
        CopilotReview --> HumanReview[Human Peer Review & Sign-Off\nSingle review session for all changes]
    end

    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge into Main])
